---
// Pricing — beta 免费 / Pro $9 / Team $19(GTM §2 定价锚)。beta 期不 gating,
// 卡片只做预期管理 + 候补引流。BYO 模型订阅的说明沿用 README 口径。
---
<section class="pricing" id="pricing">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">定价</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Beta 期间全部功能免费。模型订阅(Claude / Codex / Kimi / GLM…)自备,Planrla 不加价。</p>
    <div class="plans">
      <div class="plan">
        <div class="plan-name">Beta</div>
        <div class="plan-price">免费<span class="plan-period">· 限量席位</span></div>
        <ul class="plan-features">
          <li>全部功能,不设墙</li>
          <li>多 CLI 工作台 + 手机接管</li>
          <li>你的反馈直接进路线图</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#waitlist">加入 Beta</a>
      </div>
      <div class="plan plan-highlight">
        <div class="plan-name">Pro</div>
        <div class="plan-price">$9<span class="plan-period">/月 · 即将上线</span></div>
        <ul class="plan-features">
          <li>远程访问更高配额</li>
          <li>推送通知(权限/完成告警)</li>
          <li>长会话搜索与历史</li>
          <li>优先支持</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#waitlist">先占个位</a>
      </div>
      <div class="plan">
        <div class="plan-name">Team</div>
        <div class="plan-price">$19<span class="plan-period">/席位/月 · 即将上线</span></div>
        <ul class="plan-features">
          <li>共享看板与任务分派</li>
          <li>多机 agent 协同(A2A)</li>
          <li>团队会话同步</li>
          <li>席位与用量管理</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#waitlist">联系早期采用</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pricing { padding: 72px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .section-title { text-align: center; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .section-sub { text-align: center; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 40px; }
  .plans { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .plan {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; background: var(--color-surface);
  }
  .plan-highlight { border-color: var(--color-primary); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--color-primary); }
  .plan-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--color-muted); }
  .plan-price { font-size: 34px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .plan-period { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-muted); margin-left: 6px; }
  .plan-features { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-muted); flex: 1; }
  .plan-features li::before { content: '✓ '; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 700; }
  .btn { display: inline-block; text-align: center; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: var(--radius); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; transition: background .15s; }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--color-primary); color: var(--color-primary-fg); }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--color-primary-hover); }
  .btn-ghost { border: 1px solid var(--color-border); color: var(--color-fg); }
  .btn-ghost:hover { background: var(--color-surface-2); }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .plans { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 420px; }
  }
</style>
